            </a>
            <a href="https://handelsicecream.com/store/green/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-4 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary-300">
